<http://data.silknow.org/object/943b3d40-1d36-3f27-b106-7ece6f48c731>
        a                   ecrm:E73_Information_Object ;
        rdfs:comment        "This embroidery belongs to Group 3 identified by Jennifer Wearden in 'Azerbaijanian Embroideries: A Synthesis of Contrasts' in Hali issue 59 October 1991 pp.102-111.  Group 3 is characterised by surface darning on the diagonal using pale colours."@en ;
        ecrm:P129_is_about  <http://data.silknow.org/object/fc3954f8-caa5-3cc3-8db3-445771a6d5f3> ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/information/bibliography> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "This embroidery belongs to Group 3 identified by Jennifer Wearden in 'Azerbaijanian Embroideries: A Synthesis of Contrasts' in Hali issue 59 October 1991 pp.102-111.  Group 3 is characterised by surface darning on the diagonal using pale colours."@en .

